WEBVTT

00:13:28.516 --> 00:13:30.596
and they had a lot of fun with "cunt."

00:13:30.636 --> 00:13:32.356
One of their pornographic magazines

00:13:32.396 --> 00:13:36.276
"The Pearl" was published
from 1879 to 1880.

00:13:36.316 --> 00:13:39.956
and it published in it
"nursery rhymes" every month.

00:13:39.956 --> 00:13:42.236
I've got some here for you
to have a look at.

00:13:42.236 --> 00:13:43.916
"There was a young lady of Hitchin,

00:13:43.956 --> 00:13:45.956
Who was scrotching her cunt 
in the kitchen;

00:13:45.996 --> 00:13:48.396
Her father said, ‘Rose,
It’s the crabs, I suppose.’

00:13:48.436 --> 00:13:50.516
‘You’re right, pa,
the buggers are itching.’”

00:13:50.876 --> 00:13:54.036
“There was a young man of Bombay
Who fashioned a cunt out of clay;

00:13:54.036 --> 00:13:56.276
But the heat of his prick
Turned it into a brick,

00:13:56.316 --> 00:13:58.116
And (it) chafed all his foreskin away.”

00:13:58.156 --> 00:13:59.476
(Laughter)